     python3 orchestrator/bench_local30_gen.py                                  
     # -> eval_candidates_local30_hard.json  {id: [{model:"coder30", content,   
 ...}]}                                                                         
 Then merge + grade with bench_local30_grade.py.                                
 """                                                                            
